  "question": "layer 2's index selection comes back [1, 512] all-padding where the vendor's is [10, 5]. The runtime symbol table at that operator is correct -- SPAN_TOKENS 10, CONTEXT_LENGTH 10 -- so where are the nine query rows lost?",
