    "op_3280": "the quantised index query: [10, 32, 128] -- ten query rows, thirty-two heads, the index head dimension. CORRECT.",
    "op_3305": "the per-head weights: [10, 32] -- ten query rows. CORRECT.",
    "op_3313_area": "the compressor's own outputs earlier in the window are [1, 5, 2, 512] and [1, 5, 512]: FIVE completed groups from ten tokens at ratio 2, which is what the vendor computes.",
    "op_3315": "the INDEX SCORE: [1, 1, 5]. One batch, ONE query row, five candidates. The kernel declares [span_tokens, context_groups_ratio2] and span_tokens is 10. THIS IS THE FAULT.",
    "op_3322": "the selection: [1, 512], every slot the padding index. Correct behaviour for one query row whose single compressed group has not completed before it -- the causal mask leaves nothing to select.",
